    <detaileddescription>
<para>HSM Startup Integration Tests</para>
<para>These tests verify that:<orderedlist>
<listitem><para>Startup warning is displayed when stub HSM is active</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Warning can be suppressed with <ndash/>allow-stub-hsm flag</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Production mode blocks stub HSM without flag</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Metrics are properly exposed </para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
